  "confidence": "medium",
  "notes": "Two views of the same 15-contact connector (A-R, no G/I/O/Q): 600Ω input with OPTIONAL EXTERNAL INSERT SWITCH (DPDT, OUT/IN) and 150Ω input with no switch (B-E and J-M linked). NOTE 2: WHEN USING EXTERNAL SWITCH FACILITY, INTERNAL SWITCH 'SW6' MUST BE TURNED TO 'IN' POSITION. The B/E/J/M group is an EQ in/out switching loop: switch OUT ties B to M, bypassing E..J. Recorded as two normalled insert pairs; which of B/M is the source and which the destination is inferred, not labelled. Input/output polarity not marked. Duplicate scan, page rotated 180°."
